## https://github.com/ramonvermeulen/whosthere#key-bindings-tui
Whosthere: Start regex search                       | /
Whosthere: Up                                       | k
Whosthere: Down                                     | j
Whosthere: Go to top                                | g
Whosthere: Go to bottom                             | G
Whosthere: Copy IP of selected device               | y
Whosthere: Copy MAC of selected device              | Y
Whosthere: Show device details                      | Etr
Whosthere: Toggle theme selector                    | C-t
Whosthere: Stop application                         | C-c/q
Whosthere: Clear search / Go back                   | Esc
Whosthere: Start port scan on device (details view) | p
Whosthere: Switch button selection (modal view)     | Tab